# Document

"role.nemesis.doc" : "A neutral role that can guess other players' roles during meetings.<br>A wrong guess does not kill the Nemesis as long as allowed misses remain."
"role.nemesis.winCond" : "Guess correctly <var>%NUM%</var> times."

# Options

"options.role.nemesis.detail" : "The Nemesis guesses other players' roles,<br>and wins alone after guessing correctly the required number of times."
